# Emrakul, the Exigent Doom's grant ends only when the card its cost exiled is cast from exile (CR 611.2a, 400.7). Bot1
# exiles one Emrakul to give its Island "{T}: Add {C}{C}", then casts a second Emrakul from its hand, the Island's {U}
# paying the last of it. That cast is from the hand and of another card, so the Island keeps the ability: once the cast
# trigger has untapped it, it taps for {C}{C}. The exiled Emrakul stays in exile.

